The PaddleOCR initialization and prediction sequence in
services/paddle_ocr/engine.py is adapted from the official PaddleOCR v3.7.0
Python OCR example at docs/version3.x/pipeline_usage/OCR.en.md.
Upstream commit: b03f46425e8ff4442b268ce449e3eef758146cd4
https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR/tree/b03f46425e8ff4442b268ce449e3eef758146cd4

Local modifications: fixed CPU SDK/model versions, disabled geometric page
transformations, bounded response conversion, startup warm-up and internal HTTP
service. The actual inference implementation is reused through the official SDK;
unrelated repository modules and model weights are not copied into this repository.

Restoration changes: retain the original pinned bundle and enforce strict real
number types for OCR scores and coordinates; reject booleans and numeric strings.

